{
  "000": {
    "text": "一段家庭视频，手机能存，硬盘也能存。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "02b4112c0c5b20daa98a70426ff0ff0085ac7cc6962be70b5d2c662efc5b3548",
    "seconds": 3.84,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/000.wav"
  },
  "001": {
    "text": "要是换成一滴液体，画面还能留下来吗？",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "9f3c4acf6e004f98a30e5e4ad85f007a1653219edb1db9b9bcd549e604f17486",
    "seconds": 3.04,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/001.wav"
  },
  "002": {
    "text": "科学家试着把文件写进 DNA，再把它读回来。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "1946d3531a66032a1a3c5e6545ce8eab5c29052a0c6a964c13d89f20df1c7f34",
    "seconds": 3.36,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/002.wav"
  },
  "003": {
    "text": "DNA 的字母表只有四个符号。把二进制两位一组，就能映射成一枚碱基。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "8d96604ecbaa596fb7b6874b78b7d18073e4dc544f89913e5bdfd7bf98640889",
    "seconds": 5.84,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/003.wav"
  },
  "004": {
    "text": "文件不能只剩一串字母。算法先分片，再给每片加地址。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "c166c715467940dd821a7daa5783513f0249d94cfcf06ff897344a03896404c4",
    "seconds": 5.2,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/004.wav"
  },
  "005": {
    "text": "这样读回片段时，算法知道它来自文件哪一段。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "88609b3ed4d437c888874e6ac65c7fdb9ea13a5fdd8d8221295078147e5721ed",
    "seconds": 3.6,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/005.wav"
  },
  "006": {
    "text": "看到 DNA，算法已经留下两条线索：内容和地址。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "931f315dfa156c7e30fc57b55d0d5d4628d18bbb31665551b17dd6843f9a2ff2",
    "seconds": 4.48,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/006.wav"
  },
  "007": {
    "text": "写入前，每条候选先过质检。G、C 失衡，合成和读取都会变难。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "55a5b2d48b17f5ccca26b1cba8565a482c49074060fc2f24273270b5212008cc",
    "seconds": 6.640041666666667,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/007.wav"
  },
  "008": {
    "text": "第二关看同一字母是否连得太长。长串 A，设备容易读错。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "3e7731bd9674a8d759816a4348af4a8710aabf90333958d1472f82493b0cc0a1",
    "seconds": 5.52,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/008.wav"
  },
  "009": {
    "text": "不合格的候选会被重新映射，直到它给分子读写设备留出足够余量。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "e176cb87c376ba4c512fb0a0996e48e604d2ae8b9302b32de4311a58ad5b26eb",
    "seconds": 5.36,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/009.wav"
  },
  "010": {
    "text": "这不是把字母挑得更漂亮，而是提前承认真实世界有噪声，把风险留在写入之前处理掉。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "56a90835ab7b42b6079f9696827afa70d5082040e5e15b0fc7755dfe2fd99140",
    "seconds": 6.8,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/010.wav"
  },
  "011": {
    "text": "可只挑好序列还不够，因为保存和测序都可能让某些片段消失。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "b98d03813a9cb46ed1ade9e70899d3ca6d18106c39130615e74008a5ed0f90ae",
    "seconds": 5.52,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/011.wav"
  },
  "012": {
    "text": "DNA Fountain 算法 的想法，是把源片段随机组合成很多液滴，每滴都记住自己由哪些片段组合而成。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "b72b19ad8736a418456cc7c2209819d91aa88ba2a79d0e2a1c1880d402090e64",
    "seconds": 8.720041666666667,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/012.wav"
  },
  "013": {
    "text": "液滴足够多时，解码器先找只有一个未知数的那滴。找回一片，就能继续消掉其他未知数。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "2ed1a2ab657a711654f95cece9d7041b79476bdf2002d3c0dee1619de20ddeb0",
    "seconds": 7.76,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/013.wav"
  },
  "014": {
    "text": "所以冗余不是把文件复制很多遍，而是把恢复关系设计进组合里。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "c5d777348fb1aa3b15596f86df709bb646a495fe3ce19fa4d7908a52f633101a",
    "seconds": 4.88,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/014.wav"
  },
  "015": {
    "text": "多一些不同的组合，换来丢掉几片以后仍能恢复的机会。这是 Fountain 真正有用的地方。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "56a40931d8141994c9792dd3f35131274eca518aed8469b39be09ec8467be0e8",
    "seconds": 6.08,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/015.wav"
  },
  "016": {
    "text": "接下来进入真正麻烦的环节：合成、保存，再把 DNA 测回来。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "7ca17d5d375c4df79a0772f81968a389698f63224137c915c5894afede1d1e9c",
    "seconds": 5.04,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/016.wav"
  },
  "017": {
    "text": "读回来的不是整齐原文，可能有替换、插入、缺失，也可能整条片段根本没有被读到。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "4123009629b299ff41380b71ea497a41d76d590769838423363cdb82e2a85147",
    "seconds": 7.2000416666666665,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/017.wav"
  },
  "018": {
    "text": "画面里的红色字母是固定生成的教学样本，只用来让错误看得见，不冒充某一次真实实验。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "843ab639a50c99663a973d409416f362c1f711ca2d8996a2fb9db72cb9f46860",
    "seconds": 7.2000416666666665,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/018.wav"
  },
  "019": {
    "text": "这一步的关键不是把噪声藏起来，而是让后面的算法有证据可用。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "5031d4d09b2af3d37b688936fdcccbb85db37fa1cc1ddf252b796b532e475cd0",
    "seconds": 5.2,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/019.wav"
  },
  "020": {
    "text": "镜头跟着一条读段离开实验台，下一站是地址分桶。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "2166f93c05eecf2c29cd72054f89d253724bbecc8ed0cba2a65f338647b9ba11",
    "seconds": 4.560041666666667,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/020.wav"
  },
  "021": {
    "text": "读回的短片段，首先要找到自己的位置。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "a7c2334b49829e870646fc06a2f4791537887fbac88229e3d030051438f94585",
    "seconds": 3.36,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/021.wav"
  },
  "022": {
    "text": "同一位置的多条读段，还要做局部比对。动态规划矩阵展示的，就是这一小块相似关系。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "1283de93cd041b91a4691476dbcb829faab1a89189a1761b9f5ad71e4d0bba10",
    "seconds": 7.2000416666666665,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/022.wav"
  },
  "023": {
    "text": "对齐以后，每一列都有几种候选。质量更高的读段，投下更亮的权重。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "d1e6d0dd00c7dc29b8e31aa1df5b7a5a5716e97a4db67b8f312c90cb16aaf5fc",
    "seconds": 6.32,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/023.wav"
  },
  "024": {
    "text": "按列取共识，缺口就从多条证据的交集里补回来。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "83c8eeb2246f986dc90fb56b0b6983bf679d1c50de5c9509ddb8ff0785742ce1",
    "seconds": 4.24,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/024.wav"
  },
  "025": {
    "text": "外层纠错再补最后一层余量：编码负责写入前，局部比对和共识负责读回后。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "ddeb082365c8920a4f61d622fd9bcc22ca66fb41ec5a8f360d394738738e4e42",
    "seconds": 7.2000416666666665,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/025.wav"
  },
  "026": {
    "text": "生信算法的价值，就是把杂乱的短读段，变成可以核对的文件证据。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.55,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 560,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "aa4f7cc19fc92d47fea129f038243a27d8494685cf95249718f73f8722d2c44e",
    "seconds": 5.84,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/026.wav"
  },
  "027": {
    "text": "那大模型能帮哪一步？它先把 DNA 看成一串 token 片段，而不是一句自然语言。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
